From: virtudude <virtudude@protonmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] launcher: phone density for the Android UI

Applies to the launcher Steam installs (app 3029110).

Without a density the display HAL falls back to 180 dpi, which makes
Android's own UI (pickers, dialogs, settings) half size on a 6-inch 1080p
handheld. Games render at the surface size either way.

---
--- a/liblepton/properties.sh
+++ b/liblepton/properties.sh
@@ -47,6 +47,7 @@
     # Video/Rendering props
     props_echo "debug.stagefright.ccodec=0"
     props_echo "ro.opengles.version=196609"
+    props_echo "ro.sf.lcd_density=320"
     props_echo "ro.hardware.camera=v4l2"
 
     if [[ "${LEPTON_FORCE_SOFTWARE:-}" == "true" ]]; then
